                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr.
                            Pitkin</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-01-05"><hi rendition="#italic">January 5,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Protest against levying exceptionally large tax on foreign life-insurance
                    companies doing business in the Argentine.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Blaine</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
